WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.029
BidStream, your end-to-end bid management portal.

00:00:04.029 --> 00:00:07.105
Turn your experience into your next opportunity.

00:00:07.105 --> 00:00:10.948
Find the tenders that fit, and see why they match.

00:00:10.948 --> 00:00:16.161
The tender is out. Automated preparation turns the buyer’s brief

00:00:16.161 --> 00:00:18.402
into clear requirements, forms,

00:00:18.402 --> 00:00:22.465
and a response plan. Specialist thinking brings technical,

00:00:22.465 --> 00:00:26.529
staffing, legal, and financial expertise together.

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:31.277
Your data. AI in motion. Connected to your workspace,

00:00:31.277 --> 00:00:33.716
building the documents your team needs.

00:00:33.716 --> 00:00:36.653
Internal evaluation brings the score,

00:00:36.653 --> 00:00:40.508
the gaps, and competitor context into focus.

00:00:40.508 --> 00:00:44.119
Review the final response, and add your signature.

00:00:44.119 --> 00:00:48.902
Then ship it. BidStream. From opportunity to submission.

